ding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;建设顺序建议&lt;/strong&gt;：优先建设基础架构和信息安全层 → 核心业务系统层（ERP、MES、PLM） → 自动化执行层 → 数据平台层 → BI/AI 智能应用层&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;数据一致性&lt;/strong&gt;：所有系统必须通过数据总线进行数据交换，确保主数据在全系统唯一&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;行业合规&lt;/strong&gt;：汽车制造企业必须满足 TISAX 信息安全标准和 IATF16949 质量管理体系要求&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: list-item; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font: 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; text-align: start; white-space: normal; display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;可扩展性&lt;/strong&gt;：架构设计预留接口，支持未来新增系统和功能模块&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="z1hF5QSPwazbQEeoPt7K-83">
